| lint, whole repo | `pnpm turbo run lint --concurrency=2` | `Tasks: 47 successful, 47 total`, 0 errors in every task (warnings only). The three files changed this round, linted alone: 0 errors, 0 warnings |
| build | `pnpm turbo run build --filter='./packages/*' --concurrency=2`, then `pnpm --filter @object-ui/console build` | 39 of 39; console exit 0 |
| eager-closure budget | `node scripts/check-eager-closure-budget.mjs` | `Console eager closure is 3054.8 KB gzipped across 329 of 2345 chunks (budget: 3104.5 KB, headroom: 49.7 KB)`; `ui-components 266.5 KB / 282.2 KB`. ⛔ No ceiling or baseline moved: the script is byte-identical to main's |
| locale catalogues, SDUI pins | `node scripts/check-eager-locale-catalogues.mjs`, `pnpm check:sdui-registration-pins` | exit 0 each |
| dist | `pnpm test:dist`; `check-node-esm-load`, `check-published-dist-tooling`, `check-dist-completeness --all` | 9 of 9 tasks (components: 2 files, 8 tests); the three gates exit 0 |
| icon names | `pnpm check:icon-record-names`; `node scripts/regenerate-lucide-record-icon-names.mjs --check` | OK (184 names, record 1818 keys); the generated table matches the installed manifest |
